      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nWonderful 4 Bed Detached......House Type A - 4 Bed Detached4 bed detached 600,000c. 223m2/c. 2,400 sq. ftLarge GardenOpen Plan Kitchen/Living & DiningLarge LoungeUtility Room & Boot RoomWalk in WardrobeGranite WorktopDesigner KitchenEn-suite, Guest w.c and Main BathroomAmple parkingA-Rated Attic LadderAir to Water Heating SystemProvision for Electric CarCobble Block DrivewayFuture proof Doors and WindowsDNG New Homes are delighted to introduce Eascanrath Brook, a charming new development comprising 3 & 4 bed homes, located in one of most sought-after areas.Our stunning detached home features spacious rooms through and comprises entrance hall with high ceilings and balustrade, Open plan kitchen/living & dining, utility room, booth room / cloaks closet, guest w.c, main living room, 4 double bedrooms, full bathroom suite (bath & separate shower), walk in wardrobe, attic ladder and storage cupboard. Outside is a cobble block drive, two side passages and very large gardens. These elegant homes have been finished to an exceptional standard and specification. Each home is designed to have contemporary features and spacious light-filled rooms that create an efficient living environment with stunning finishes throughout.Register your interest today."
